1-8 attempts); the generic reader and approved image are unchanged. Native root/definition/alarm-metadata payloads are 77,304/7,308/16,616 bytes. Scan median/max is 437/3,111 us with zero overlaps. Genealogy and MANUAL=1 readiness are restored; see Evidence/AB_S3D_CANONICAL_RUNTIME_2026-10-22.md. Later surfaces and shipping activation remain open. S3e offline preparation passes at 2,154 paths: 29 Access/data-policy paths and in-place audit enrichment on the existing ring. The generic BITSTRING32 rule preserves unsigned result words; all prior images/replays remain unchanged. Both v38 builds/read-back/access and 2,078 AB tests pass; measured Capacity is 1,568,852 / 3,145,728 Blocks (49%). S3e runtime passes at 2,154 paths: 31 inherited candidate rows plus two Access checks, 54 replayed paired captures including idle, six Access phases and 31 restored-baseline rows. A corrected owner-derived audit uses MANUAL gate 2; its initial wrong-index audit and a partial repeat with three extra rows remain archived. All 76 prepared root sources match again, with no PLC/image/proof change. Native payloads total 101,780 bytes; candidate median/max is 817/4,033 us with zero overlaps. Genealogy, MANUAL=1 readiness, five documents, original policy and preflight are restored. See Evidence/AB_S3E_CANONICAL_RUNTIME_2026-10-22.md. S3e approval is consumed; later surfaces and shipping activation remain open. See AB_CANONICAL_PUBLICATION_S3E_NOTES_2026-10-22.md."
